07:52.000 --> 07:53.950
Four.

07:54.000 --> 07:56.950
Weighted.

07:57.000 --> 07:58.950
Five.

07:59.000 --> 08:00.950
Searched.

08:01.000 --> 08:02.950
Six.

08:03.000 --> 08:04.950
Needed.

08:05.000 --> 08:07.000
Seven.

08:08.000 --> 08:09.950
